{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00256",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.51,
      "end_seconds": 3.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Hi, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.28,
      "end_seconds": 7.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "No trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.92,
      "end_seconds": 18.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.63,
      "text": "It's dizziness when I stand up, mostly. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.79,
      "end_seconds": 21.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.92,
      "end_seconds": 30.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "Right, it's been about a week, I'm fairly sure. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.25,
      "end_seconds": 33.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Right. How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.71,
      "end_seconds": 35.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.83,
      "end_seconds": 38.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Any muscle cramps as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.07,
      "end_seconds": 45.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Yeah. One week, I'd say. Well, as for muscle cramps, mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.94,
      "end_seconds": 48.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Have you had diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.18,
      "end_seconds": 50.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.29,
      "end_seconds": 56.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.68,
      "end_seconds": 59.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Um, yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.78,
      "end_seconds": 65.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any vomiting, fever, confusion or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.22,
      "end_seconds": 67.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.31,
      "end_seconds": 70.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Has there been any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.75,
      "end_seconds": 74.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Right, no chest pain, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.33,
      "end_seconds": 78.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.11,
      "end_seconds": 83.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.9,
      "end_seconds": 86.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Right, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.05,
      "end_seconds": 91.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.77,
      "end_seconds": 107.69,
      "duration_seconds": 15.92,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.94,
      "end_seconds": 111.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.43,
      "end_seconds": 114.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.3,
      "end_seconds": 126.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for about ten years now. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.93,
      "end_seconds": 130.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.18,
      "end_seconds": 148.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.31,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.05,
      "end_seconds": 153.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.6,
      "end_seconds": 158.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Dust. I come out in... well, itchy eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.25,
      "end_seconds": 161.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.41,
      "end_seconds": 164.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.12,
      "end_seconds": 175.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.3,
      "end_seconds": 188.22,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I take ORS, whenever I remember."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.81,
      "end_seconds": 191.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.05,
      "end_seconds": 194.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "For six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.14,
      "end_seconds": 199.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Alright, I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.86,
      "end_seconds": 201.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.79,
      "end_seconds": 204.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.22,
      "end_seconds": 207.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.73,
      "end_seconds": 211.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.81,
      "end_seconds": 212.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.33,
      "end_seconds": 229.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.44,
      "end_seconds": 245.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "So, just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.62,
      "end_seconds": 270.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.62,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 31.2, temp 37.1 degrees, heart rate 112, height 161 centimetres, saturation 96 percent, weight 81 kilos, blood pressure 102 over 58."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.57,
      "end_seconds": 272.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.92,
      "end_seconds": 276.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.99,
      "end_seconds": 280.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.38,
      "end_seconds": 299.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.23,
      "end_seconds": 303.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.21,
      "end_seconds": 307.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.36,
      "end_seconds": 321.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Your mouth is quite dry and the skin is a little slow to spring back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.9,
      "end_seconds": 326.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.47,
      "end_seconds": 331.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.58,
      "end_seconds": 332.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.59,
      "end_seconds": 358.93,
      "duration_seconds": 12.34,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Putting it all together, this looks most like dehydration from a stomach bug. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I can't rule out an electrolyte imbalance yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.48,
      "end_seconds": 362.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.49,
      "end_seconds": 378.05,
      "duration_seconds": 15.56,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like dehydration from a stomach bug, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had dizziness when you stand up for about a week, severe, and no fainting or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.43,
      "end_seconds": 381.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.0,
      "end_seconds": 384.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.17,
      "end_seconds": 385.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.92,
      "end_seconds": 403.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I'd like to arrange a kidney function test for dehydration. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 404.93,
      "end_seconds": 408.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "We have a slot Friday at 2 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.85,
      "end_seconds": 411.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.71,
      "end_seconds": 441.34,
      "duration_seconds": 28.63,
      "text": "Small, frequent sips are better than a big glass at once, and keep going even if you don't feel thirsty. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you faint or can't keep any fluids down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 441.66,
      "end_seconds": 443.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 443.56,
      "end_seconds": 451.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in three days. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 452.98,
      "end_seconds": 457.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "So, I come back in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.69,
      "end_seconds": 463.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 463.55,
      "end_seconds": 465.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 466.2,
      "end_seconds": 467.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}